Fingerprint highlight (negronifp_hl=1|2, default 0): a white disc at the sensor position drawn into the
panel memory after each copy (every GPU frame waits on its fence, as the badges do), and the panel HBM-on
DCS set (live.dts 33140) once. Applies after 0267/0268.
Details: docs/fingerprint-plan.md, patches/xnu/README-fingerprint.md.

